<view class="page">
  <view class="cover">
    <image
      src="/assets/xinma-poster.jpg"
      mode="aspectFill"
    />
    <view class="cover-mask"></view>
    <view class="cover-content">
      <view class="tags"><text
          wx:for="{{trip.tags}}"
          wx:key="*this"
        >{{item}}</text></view>
      <view class="cover-title">{{trip.title}}</view>
      <view class="cover-subtitle">{{trip.subtitle}}</view>
      <view class="cover-copy">一次旅程畅游两国经典地标，第一次去东南亚，就从新马开始。</view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="container">
    <view class="price-card glass-card">
      <view><text class="price">¥{{trip.price}}</text><text class="unit"> / 人起</text></view><text
        class="date">{{trip.dates.join(' / ')}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="section-title"><text class="main">产品亮点</text><text class="sub">双国经典线路</text></view>
    <view class="highlight-grid">
      <view
        wx:for="{{trip.highlights}}"
        wx:key="title"
        class="highlight-card"
      ><text class="highlight-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="highlight-desc">{{item.desc}}</text><text
          class="highlight-num"
        >0{{index+1}}</text></view>
    </view>
    <view class="section-title"><text class="main">行程安排</text><text class="sub">5天4晚</text></view>
    <view class="timeline">
      <view
        wx:for="{{trip.itinerary}}"
        wx:key="day"
        class="timeline-item"
      >
        <view class="timeline-dot"></view>
        <view class="timeline-card"><text class="timeline-day">{{item.day}}</text><text
            class="timeline-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="timeline-desc">{{item.desc}}</text></view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="section-title"><text class="main">预订须知</text></view>
    <view class="notice glass-card">
      <view class="notice-row"><text>出发地</text><text>广州直飞，广东多地可集合</text></view>
      <view class="notice-row"><text>住宿</text><text>新加坡精品酒店1晚，马来西亚四钻酒店3晚</text></view>
      <view class="notice-row"><text>签证</text><text>新加坡、马来西亚免签，需持有效护照</text></view>
      <view class="notice-row"><text>适合人群</text><text>亲子、情侣、朋友、首次出境游客</text></view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="bottom-bar">
    <view
      class="bottom-mini"
      bindtap="favorite"
    ><text class="icon">♡</text><text>收藏</text></view>
    <view
      class="bottom-mini"
      bindtap="contact"
    ><text class="icon">☏</text><text>客服</text></view><button
      class="signup-btn"
      bindtap="goSignup"
      style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"
    >立即报名</button>
  </view>
</view>
